GLI reference-equation data
===========================

The JSON files in src/reference/data/ were derived from the Global Lung Function Initiative
lookup workbooks listed in src/reference/sources.json (URLs, download date, byte size and sha256
of each input). They are NOT covered by the MIT license that applies to the rest of this repository.

Per the project physician's reading of the ERS terms (summary recorded in SPEC.md): the equations
and lookup tables are freely available for implementation; official GLI software is restricted to
research, education, training and validation and is not approved for direct patient treatment;
the material is distributed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial license, and
commercial use requires permission from the European Respiratory Society.

